<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK 1-WK REPO AVERAGE YIELD HITS 15.2 PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK 1-WK REPO AVERAGE YIELD HITS 15.2 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in the Czech National Bank's one-week repo tender on Wednesday morning hit 15.2 percent down from 15.7 percent in a similar operation on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Minimum yield was 15.19 percent and all bids made at the maximum level, which was the same as the average, were accepted.</p>
<p>The central bank does not release the volumes of the transactions.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
